Magni wrote:
>
> a rock troll (HOW DO YOU MAKE THESE STAY DEAD?!)

Any way that destroys the corpse before it reanimates.  Eat,
polymorph, pet eats, stone.  Notably a wand of turn undead
isn't in the list, chuckle.

But consider that the level you start encountering trolls is a
level where the number of points per kill still matter somewhat.
The points are worth it and every so often the reanimated
troll drops another item.  Trolls don't reanimate every time.
Each time you kill one there's a chance it will remain dead.
I haven't run the odds but remembering play it seems to be
in the 5-10% range.

So go ahead and clear the level out of other monsters and
just keep killing the troll until it doesn't come back, until you
are happy with exploring that level.  The troll might not come
back but until then just keep killing it unless you get hungry.
